 42: - Just provide the methods, do not add a sentence at the beginning saying showing your thinking process
 43: **Mathematical Computations:**
 44: - For any mathematical derivations, equations, or symbolic computations, use the wolfram_compute tool to get exact solutions and LaTeX formatting.
